    <string name="reverse_landscape_hint">Flips the game to the opposite landscape — still fixed, no free rotation. Turn on if your gamepad or cradle holds the phone the other way up.</string>
    <string name="compat_mode_label">Compatibility mode</string>
    <string name="compat_mode_hint">Turn on if the game won\'t start (black screen / stuck on loading). A bit slower, but helps it launch on some devices.</string>
    <string name="compat_mode_dialog_title">Compatibility mode — please read</string>
    <string name="compat_mode_dialog_msg">This is a temporary workaround. It may not work, or only work partially (graphics glitches, missing textures, errors on load).\n\nIf you get save problems — colonists disappearing from your saves — download and install the <b>RimDroidSaveFix</b> mod.</string>
